 - `app/src/main/java/com/dsharnessmobile/shell/AppFilesDocumentsProvider.kt`: System SAF provider exposes only the app's `filesDir` through user-granted document URIs; no public file-serving endpoint. Manifest `MANAGE_DOCUMENTS` binding permission; folder browse, read/write, create, rename and non-recursive delete. This path belongs to the K06 file/SAF integration boundary.
 - `app/src/main/java/com/dsharnessmobile/shell/AppDocumentsPath.kt`: exact `files:` ID-to-path translation, canonical root checks and traversal/symlink containment. Tests: `app/src/test/java/com/dsharnessmobile/shell/AppDocumentsPathTest.kt`. Never resolve external paths directly from document IDs.
 - `app/src/main/java/com/dsharnessmobile/shell/GuideManagementController.kt`: Korean UI language is forced (language selector removed); the color mode buttons group a centered Android vector and label and use semicircular outer caps. Tests: `AppThemeTest.kt`.
+
+
+### Korean-only Android process-wide locale
+
+- `app/src/main/java/com/dsharnessmobile/shell/KoreanOnlyApplication.kt`: declared in `AndroidManifest.xml`, forces Android `Locale.KOREAN` for every app process, including boot-triggered/background services.
+- `AppLanguage.kt` ignores obsolete UI language preference values and forces Korean for WebView/bootstrap/engine profile. `UiText.kt` and `DsLocale.kt` use process locale, preserving Chinese baseline-copy tests in a plain JVM without an Android Application; there is **no user-facing language selector**. Tests: `AppLanguageTest.kt`, `AppThemeTest.kt`.
